{{PageBanner|World trigger en.png|event}}
A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the popular anime known as '''World Trigger''' (ワールドトリガー, ''Wārudo Torigā'', '''World Trigger''') was held from October 13th, 2022 to October 27th, 2022. The collaboration includes exclusive stages, [[Catnip Challenges]] and stamps going on during collaboration the period.<br>
The anime is published by [[wikipedia:Shueisha|Shueisha]].

==Event Information==
The worlds of World Trigger and the Battle Cats collide in our newest collaboration event!<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''On from November 7, 2022 (11:00 am) until November 21, 2022 (10:59 am).'''}}

Collab stages have been added featuring the virtual world from World Trigger! Take on the members of Tamakoma Second in a mock battle!<br>
Visit the Legend Stories during this campaign, tap "Battle", to challenge the collab stages below!

<nowiki>*</nowiki>If the stages do not appear for you, please be sure to update to the latest version of the Battle Cats.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''Collab stage: Battle! Tamakoma Second's Leader'''}}<br>
Battle the leader of Tamakoma Second, Osamu Mikumo in a trial battle! Clearing any stage in this map will give a small chance to pick up the {{Color|#FF6D01|'''Limited Collab Unit "Osamu Mikumo & Cat"'''}} as a reward!<br>
Later, more difficult stages in the map will give a higher chance to collect Osamu Mikumo & Cat as a clear reward! Clear the stage faster to earn a better score and get the best prizes!<br>
(Use a Treasure Radar for a 100% chance to collect stage clear rewards!)

※ Osamu Mikumo & Cat can be activated at the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu after being collected as a stage reward.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''Collab stage: Battle! Tamakoma Second's Ace!'''}}<br>
Battle the ace of Tamakoma Second, Yuma Kuga in a trial battle! Clearing any stage in this map will give a small chance to pick up the {{Color|#FF6D01|'''Limited Collab Unit "Yuma Kuga & Cat"'''}} as a reward!<br>
Later, more difficult stages in the map will give a higher chance to collect Yuma Kuga & Cat as a clear reward! Clear the stage faster to earn a better score and get the best prizes!<br>
(Use a Treasure Radar for a 100% chance to collect stage clear rewards!)

※ Yuma Kuga & Cat can be activated at the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu after being collected as a stage reward.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''Collab stage: Vs Training Marmod!'''}}<br>
Only characters earned from collab stages or the limited-time log-in bonuses can be used in this stage! Use [[Osamu Mikumo & Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#46BDC6|'''Osamu Mikumo & Cat'''}}]]{{Color|#46BDC6|''','''}} [[Yuma Kuga & Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#46BDC6|'''Yuma Kuga & Cat'''}}]]{{Color|#46BDC6|''', and'''}} [[Chika Amatori & Cat (Special Cat)|{{Color|#46BDC6|'''Chika Amatori & Cat'''}}]] to defeat Marmod! {{Color|#FF6D01|'''Available from November 14, 2022 (11:00 am) until November 21, 2022 (10:59 am)!'''}}<br>
Strengthen the members of Border to make defeating Marmod even easier! Stage rewards include Cat Tickets and Rare Tickets!

*Log-in every day during the event to earn limited-time characters and Rare Tickets!
Logging in for 7 days will earn you the {{Color|#FF6D01|'''limited-time Special characters Chika Amatori & Cat'''}}! There is a different item for every day of the event, so don't forget to log in and claim your gifts!

※ Chika Amatori & Cat can be activated at the Special Cats section of the Upgrade menu after being collected as a log-in bonus.
※ There are 14 days worth of log-in rewards for this collab event.


